--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The JPEG codec in this package is a Python reimplementation of the libjpeg
6b code that OutGuess ships with. Its quantisation tables, Huffman tables,
integer DCT/IDCT and chroma sampling routines are derived from the
Independent JPEG Group's libjpeg 6b, which carries this notice:

    This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG
    Group.

libjpeg's own terms permit use, copying, modification and distribution for
any purpose and without fee, provided that the above acknowledgement appears
in all copies.
